### [1] 容器内交叉编译验证程序（tests/riscv/hello）
$ riscv64-linux-gnu-gcc --version
riscv64-linux-gnu-gcc (Ubuntu 13.3.0-6ubuntu2~24.04.1) 13.3.0
$ make clean && make NEMU_HOME=/work/work/NEMU HOST_IP=192.168.30.213
NEMU_HOME          = /work/work/NEMU
NEMU_COMMIT        = 90908390002f
CONFIG_MBASE       = 0x80000000
CONFIG_UARTLITE_MMIO = 0x40600000
VLEN               = 128
HOST_IP            = 192.168.30.213
GEN  build/nemu_config.h
GEN  build/hello.ld
riscv64-linux-gnu-gcc -march=rv64gcv_zve64x -mabi=lp64d -mcmodel=medany -ffreestanding -nostdlib -nostartfiles -fno-builtin -fno-pic -fno-tree-vectorize -O2 -g -Wall -Wextra -Ibuild -nostdlib -nostartfiles -Wl,--build-id=none -Wl,-Map,build/hello.map -T build/hello.ld -o build/hello.elf start.S hello.c
/usr/lib/gcc-cross/riscv64-linux-gnu/13/../../../../riscv64-linux-gnu/bin/ld: warning: build/hello.elf has a LOAD segment with RWX permissions
LD   build/hello.elf
riscv64-linux-gnu-objcopy -O binary build/hello.elf build/hello.bin
BIN  build/hello.bin  (3520 bytes)
riscv64-linux-gnu-objdump -d -M no-aliases build/hello.elf > build/hello.dis
DIS  build/hello.dis

### [2] 证据：产物是 RISC-V 机器码，字符串与串口写操作都在程序里
$ file build/hello.elf
build/hello.elf: ELF 64-bit LSB executable, UCB RISC-V, RVC, double-float ABI, version 1 (SYSV), dynamically linked, interpreter /lib/ld-linux-riscv64-lp64d.so.1, with debug_info, not stripped

$ ls -l build/hello.bin
-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 3520 Oct 24 10:42 build/hello.bin

$ riscv64-linux-gnu-readelf -h build/hello.elf | grep -E "Machine|Entry"
  Machine:                           RISC-V
  Entry point address:               0x80000000

$ strings -t x build/hello.bin | grep "hello xiangshan"   (验证串只存在于程序的只读数据里)
    bd0 hello xiangshan, I am cie2026-vdot, IP address 192.168.30.213

$ grep -n -B4 -A4 40600004 build/hello.dis   (putch 被内联：lui 0x40600 + addi 4 得到 TX FIFO 地址，再 sb 写字节)
28-    8000003e:	406006b7          	lui	a3,0x40600
29-    80000042:	03000713          	addi	a4,zero,48
30-    80000046:	00000797          	auipc	a5,0x0
31-    8000004a:	78278793          	addi	a5,a5,1922 # 800007c8 <main+0x59c>
32:    8000004e:	0691                	c.addi	a3,4 # 40600004 <_start-0x3f9ffffc>
33-    80000050:	0785                	c.addi	a5,1
34-    80000052:	00e68023          	sb	a4,0(a3)
35-    80000056:	0007c703          	lbu	a4,0(a5)
36-    8000005a:	fb7d                	c.bnez	a4,80000050 <put_hex+0x12>
--

$ grep -n -B2 -A3 vadd.vv build/hello.dis   (RVV 1.0 向量加法自检段)
526-    80000670:	02030087          	vle8.v	v1,(t1)
527-    80000674:	020e0107          	vle8.v	v2,(t3)
528:    80000678:	021101d7          	vadd.vv	v3,v1,v2
529-    8000067c:	020701a7          	vse8.v	v3,(a4)
530-    80000680:	4401                	c.li	s0,0
531-    80000682:	4841                	c.li	a6,16

